  m_text: The official test will now begin. Please click the button below to open
    the questionnaire link. Do not close the app during gameplay. After each boss
    battle, please switch applications and return to the questionnaire page to answer
    the relevant questions for that boss. You will then encounter four boss battles,
    during which the boss dialogue will be slightly different; please observe carefully.
